{"id":174,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"和と探究で伸びる奈良登美ヶ丘中高","feature_description":"奈良学園登美ヶ丘中学校・高等学校は、建学の精神である『逞しく生きる力』『和の精神』『科学的に物事を見る力』を土台に、学びと部活動の両立を推奨しています。充実した設備と熱心な指導のもと、クラブ活動が活発で、生徒の個性と協働を同時に育てる校風です。学年を越えた交流や多彩なクラブが、主体性と協働性を広げます。中高一貫ならではの積み上げで、進学と人間形成を両立します。","clubs":[{"id":3093,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3094,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3095,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3096,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3097,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3098,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3099,"name":"柔道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3100,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3101,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3102,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3103,"name":"室内楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":3104,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://www.naragakuen.jp/tomigaoka/t_jun/life/club/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":310